Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:25.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:56.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《银额马》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.83,0:02:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情不妙 我必须要去一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's no good. I shall have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去一趟？去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Go? Go where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}金斯皮兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}King's Pyland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.26,0:02:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨天晚上德文郡警局的格雷戈里督察\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Last evening Inspector Gregory of the Devonshire Constabulary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.18,0:02:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逮捕了知名的赛马人菲茨罗·伊辛普森\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}arrested well known racing personality Fitzroy Simpson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.93,0:02:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且控诉他谋杀了驯马师约翰·斯特拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and charged him with the murder of trainer, John Straker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:02:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又有两封电报 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Two more telegrams, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.03,0:02:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 哈德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you, Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.45,0:02:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这两天一直在 又是格雷戈里督察发来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You've been bombarded with these the last couple of days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和一封罗斯上校的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A note from Colonel Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哇 那是马的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Awe, that's the horse's owner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.42,0:03:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我犯了一个大错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I had made a blunder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.05,0:03:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是那些只读了你的传记\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which I am afraid is a more common occurrence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.30,0:03:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而知道我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}than anyone would think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.43,0:03:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会想到的一件常事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}who only knew me through your memoirs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.01,0:03:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过事实是我不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But the fact is that I could not believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像银额马这样一匹一眼就能认出的马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that so a remarkable a horse as Silver Blaze{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.07,0:03:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会就这么消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}could disappear, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特别是在像达特穆尔 这样的僻静之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}especially in the seclusion of somewhere like Dartmoor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.06,0:03:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无时无刻都希望可以听到消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}From hour to hour I expect to hear that the abductor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.02,0:03:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个拐马者就是杀害约翰·斯特拉的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}was the murderer of John Straker{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且马也找回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and the horse had been found{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.48,0:03:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是看上去不是这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but that doesn't seem to be the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会很乐意跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I should be happy to go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.36,0:03:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 在塔维斯托克呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No, Tavistock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.49,0:03:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我不妨碍你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If I should not be in the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.33,0:03:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我亲爱的华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh my dear Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.29,0:03:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你愿意同去是对我很大的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}you would confer a great favour upon me by coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信不会浪费你的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm sure your time will not be misspent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我保证这绝对是件独一无二的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The case promises to be absolutely unique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.76,0:03:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们正好能赶上去帕丁顿的火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We can just catch our train from Paddington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.55,0:04:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 华生 你可以带上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh Watson, would you be so kind as to bring{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.29,0:04:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的双筒望远镜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}your field glasses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 我们要去达特穆尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mrs. Hudson, were off to Dartmoor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请出示车票\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Tickets please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.05,0:04:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 巡票员\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.39,0:04:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.11,0:05:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 我们今天的速度不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Watson, we're going well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.61,0:05:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在的速度是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Our speed at present is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每小时五十三英里半\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}fifty-three and half miles an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没留心去数每隔四分之一英里的路杆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I've not observed the quarter mile post.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Nor have I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是这条铁路边的电线杆的间隔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But the telegraphed posts on this line{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.28,0:05:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是六十码\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}are sixty yards apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是很简单的计算\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The calculation is a simple one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那份受人瞩目 喜欢过度渲染的体育报纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Has that remarkably, colored, sporting paper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提到了任何关于我们的马的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}anything to say on the subject of our horse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.73,0:05:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.81,0:05:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.86,0:05:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.49,0:05:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.45,0:05:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}银额马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Silver Blaze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.31,0:05:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}银额马拥有索默密的血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Silver Blaze is from lsonomy stock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索默密\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Isonomy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且像它著名的祖先一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And holds as brilliant a record{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.75,0:05:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保持着辉煌的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}as his famous ancestor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:05:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它现在五岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He's now in his fifth year{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每次都能在赛马场上 为他幸运的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and has brought in turn each of the prize of the turf{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.67,0:06:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗斯上校赢得奖金\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to Colonel Ross his fortunate owner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.26,0:06:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}眼下灾难发生之际\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}At the time of the catastrophe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它是威塞克斯杯中最有望夺冠的一匹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}he was first favored for the Wessex Cup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.56,0:06:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赔率是二比一\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The odds quoted being two to one against.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.23,0:06:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为赛马嗜好者一向最爱的宠驹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He's always been a prime favorite of the racing public{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.30,0:06:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从来没有让他们失望过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and has never yet disappointed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.15,0:06:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管赌注悬殊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}In spite of the unfavorable prize, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.37,0:06:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是有巨款押在了它身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}a great deal of money has been placed upon him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.57,0:06:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以很明显 许多人出于\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}so it is obvious, therefore, that there are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.07,0:06:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自身利益的考量 会想方设法\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}many people with the strongest interest in preventing Silver Blaze{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阻止银额马出赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}from being there at the fall of the flag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 贝恩斯 请在这里停一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}All right, Baynes, will you stop here please, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.55,0:06:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里的风景不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}cause this is a rather good view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那边就是金斯皮兰 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now that's King's Pyland over there Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.56,0:07:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的驯马厩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You know my training stable where the missing horse was kept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那处是驯马师的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well, there's the trainer's house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的斯特拉克和他的老婆住在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}where poor Straker lived with his wife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一个女仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and a maidservant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.12,0:07:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他跟在你身边多久了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}How long had he been with you sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 当了我五年的骑师\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh, five years at jockey{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.71,0:07:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到他发福无法再上马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}until he got too heavy for the weighing chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.79,0:07:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接下来七年做了我的驯马师\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Then seven years as my trainer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.63,0:07:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他水平一流\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, he was a first class man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.55,0:07:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜更远处就是马厩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And I presume the stables are beyond?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.26,0:07:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 马场不大但是很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, yes not a big yard, it's a good one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我注重的是质量不是数量\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My thought is quality not quantity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在赛马场上活跃的人都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}As anyone connected with the turf will{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉你这点 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}tell you, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 督察 你看 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, thank you, Inspector. You see, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.89,0:07:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马场里只养了五匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}at the moment I'm merely five horses in the yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你让其中两匹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I see you have two of them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.63,0:07:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}参加了威塞克斯杯 罗斯上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}entered for the Wessex Cup, Colonel Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 是的 银额马和贝阿得\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That's right, yes. Yes, Silver Blaze and Bayard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可别说出去 派上贝阿得是为了去领跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But between us Bayard is intended for a pacemaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.08,0:07:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}训练这么名贵的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well with such valuable animals under his charge, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你的驯马师斯特拉克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I imagine your trainer Mr. Straker{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.31,0:07:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定采取了一些预防措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}must have taken some precautions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 没有错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh yes indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有三个小马倌和马匹一起生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Three stable lads lived with the horses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天黑之后其中一个 会在马厩值班\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and after dark one of the lads was always on duty in the stables{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.84,0:08:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他两个会睡在阁楼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}while the other two sleep above in loft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那边是不是还有一个驯马场？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Is that another training stable over there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.60,0:08:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 那里是梅普尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, that's Mapleton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.89,0:08:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布莱克沃特勋爵的马场\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Lord Backwater's yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布莱克沃特勋爵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Lord Backwater?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布莱克沃特勋爵有匹德丝贝里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Lord Backwater owns Desberly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.94,0:08:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是威塞克斯杯的二号种子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}second favorite for the Wessex Cup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是匹不错的马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This is not a bad horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.91,0:08:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但和银额马不是一个等级的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not in the same class as Silver Blaze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.11,0:08:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个人叫西拉斯·布朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Fellow called, Silas Brown, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是贝克华特的驯马师 谜一样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}trains for Backwater, I can't stick the fellow himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连斯特拉克也搞不懂他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Nor could Straker come to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是竞争对手的缘故吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There's a natural rivalry I presume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.71,0:08:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不止如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Rather more than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以继续走了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Shall we drive on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.67,0:08:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走了 贝恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}All right, Baynes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.30,0:08:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格雷戈里督察\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Inspector Gregory, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对马匹去向的调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}are there any further developments as to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.24,0:08:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有没有进展？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the whereabouts of the horse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.81,0:08:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Nothing at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在这个方面 几乎停滞不前\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We have made very little progress in that direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.23,0:09:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能想象像这样一匹银额马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I can't imagine how a horse like Silver Blaze{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.11,0:09:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会在这样的地方失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}could go missing for so long in a place like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.32,0:09:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Nor can I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须告诉你 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I must tell you Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.03,0:09:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一开始并不完全接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that at first I was not at all taken{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格雷戈里督察的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with Inspector Gregory's suggestion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把你请到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that you should be asked to come down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.28,0:09:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不喜欢业余的 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I don't like amateurs, you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.53,0:09:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.04,0:09:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你还是给我发了电报 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But you did send me a telegram, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.96,0:09:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来没有别人可以找到我的马了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well no one else seems to be able to find my horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你问我会是谁 我会说是那些散居在\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If you ask me it's these damn gypsies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.14,0:09:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}荒野上的该死的吉普赛浪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}wondering all over the moor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早晚会出丑事 我说这话很多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's a perfect scandal, I've said so for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的人在过去的两天中\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My men have seen every group{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}调查了在达特穆尔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of gypsies on Dartmoor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.77,0:09:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每个吉普赛人 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in the last two days, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.19,0:09:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且搜查了南德文郡的每个马厩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And searched every stable yard, quarry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.39,0:09:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}采石场和洞穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and cave in south Devon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.31,0:09:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这绝对是一个迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's an absolute mystery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.73,0:10:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我期待你能创造奇迹 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I expect a miracle from you, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格雷戈里督察\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Inspector Gregory, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在苏格兰场的朋友跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}my friends at Scotland Yard tell me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.25,0:10:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你迅速地建立了自己的声誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that you're rapidly making a reputation for yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在英国侦探圈中\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in the English detective service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也是个热心学习您办案方法的学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm a keen student of your methods too, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有两个主要证人在等您\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have the two principle, witnesses waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.77,0:11:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这里 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}In here, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.52,0:11:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Who are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女仆伊迪丝·巴克斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Edith Baxter, the maid and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:11:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}值班的马童亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Hunter, the stable boy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:11:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及在星期一晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}who was on duty on Monday night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是九点刚过几分 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It was just a few minutes after nine o'clock, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我端着亨特先生的晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was carrying Mr. Hunter supper across from the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.55,0:12:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚餐吃的是什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}what did the supper consist of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.80,0:12:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是一盘咖喱羊肉 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It was a dish of curried mutton, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}突然我听见了一个男人的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Suddenly I heard a man's voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.89,0:13:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以告诉你 先生 我完全没有心理准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Did not give me a turn, I can tell you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好意思 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Excuse me, Miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.90,0:13:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想干什么 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What do you want, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.61,0:13:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能告诉我这是哪里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Can you tell me where I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.74,0:13:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在我几乎决定露宿荒野的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'd almost made up my mind to sleep on the moor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看见了这里的灯光\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}when I saw the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.20,0:13:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里是金斯皮兰驯马场 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This is King's Pyland training stable, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那真是太走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What a stroke of luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.08,0:13:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道会有小马倌晚上睡在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I understand there's stable lad who sleeps here at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.09,0:13:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问你端的是他的晚餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No doubt that's his supper you have there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信你不会那么骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm sure you wouldn't be too proud{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.30,0:13:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连一条新裙子的钱也不屑赚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to earn yourself the price of a new dress would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看 今晚把这个给那男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}See the boy has this tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.31,0:13:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就能得到可以买一条最漂亮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and you shall have the prettiest frock money can buy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能要\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I couldn't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}内德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Ned!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.40,0:13:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}内德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Ned!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}内德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Ned!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.69,0:14:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}外面有一个男人拦住了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There's a man stopped me out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.05,0:14:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm ever so frightened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.36,0:14:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What did he want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他问起了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He asked after you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我给你一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He asked me to give you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.41,0:14:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.79,0:14:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 是一样白色的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I don't know. It was white.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.33,0:14:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Where is he now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.12,0:14:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.83,0:14:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你最好马上回屋去告诉老爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We best cut back to the house. Quick tell the governor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.13,0:14:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 内德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes Ned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚上好 我想和你说几句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good evening I want a word with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.11,0:14:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来这里有什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What business have you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是件能让你的口袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's a business that may put something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鼓起来的买卖 小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in your pocket, my lad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你现在有两匹参加威塞克斯杯的马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now you've two horses entering the Wessex Cup, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.33,0:14:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}银额马和贝阿得\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Silver Blaze and Bayard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.83,0:14:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我透点内幕 不会对你有坏处\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Let me have the straight tip and you won't be the loser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贝阿得真的可以在\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Is it the fact that at the weights Bayard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.57,0:15:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}五弗隆的距离里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}can give the other a hundred yards{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.80,0:15:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}超过银额马一百码吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and five furlongs in the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你别想从我这里得到任何消息 滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You wont get any tips around here, get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}追上他 追上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}After him boy, after him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老爷和其他人已经来得很及时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The governor and the others came down soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.99,0:15:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们没有找到那个男人的半点踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We found not a sight or sound of the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}One moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把狗放出去之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}When you let the dog out did you leave{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.91,0:15:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}门有没有关上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the door open behind you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问得好 华生 问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh excellent, Watson, excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.53,0:15:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这正是我要问的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It's just the point I was going to make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把门锁上了 先生 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I locked the door behind me sir. I swear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good lad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}菲茨罗·伊辛普森认罪了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Does Fitzroy Simpson admit to all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.30,0:15:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对此全盘否认\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He denies nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.97,0:15:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说来这是为了买消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He says he came for information…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.18,0:15:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那张白条是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What about the white paper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.35,0:16:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说那是一张五镑纸币\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He says it was a five-pound note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.07,0:16:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接下来发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What happened next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是天刚亮的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it was about dawn when{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.74,0:16:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女主人走进我的卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the mistress came into my bedroom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.53,0:16:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叫我跟她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and told me to come with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.16,0:16:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当她醒来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well when she woke{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.85,0:16:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发现斯特拉克先生的床是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}she'd found Mr. Straker's bed empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.88,0:16:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 马不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Heavens! The horse is gone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.85,0:16:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有马勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And the bridle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.15,0:16:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}内德 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Ned, wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把他叫醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Wake the boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}内德 内德 醒醒 醒醒 内德\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Ned! Ned! Wake up. Wake up, Ned!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比尔 罗比 快来 银额马不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Bill, Robbie come quick, Silver Blaze is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.15,0:18:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他死了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He was dead sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.32,0:18:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}His head, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被打得陷进去了一块\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it was all knocked in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实在是太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It was terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.40,0:18:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}头部受到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It was a terrible blow on the head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是他的死因 某种钝器的重击\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}from some blunt instrument that had killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.66,0:19:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很明显 他曾拼命抵抗过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It was clear that he had defended himself most vigorously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一把血迹斑斑的小刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The blood stained knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和大腿上伤口 你们说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}As to the wound on the thigh, who can tell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.67,0:19:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}腿上的伤口可能是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well it is possible that the wound on the thigh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.59,0:19:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯特拉克摔倒的时候造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}could have been caused as Straker fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.76,0:19:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个男孩被下药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The lad here was drugged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他的咖喱中有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Appreciable quantities of powered opium{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.75,0:19:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定分量的麻醉药\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}were found in his carry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.43,0:19:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有人吃得都是一样的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Did all the household eat the same dish?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.18,0:19:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生 我亲自下厨再端上餐桌\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes sir, I made it myself and served it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.77,0:19:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这条黑红色的围巾\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This black and red scarf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.27,0:19:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那位先生跟我说话时\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The gentleman was wearing that scarf{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.32,0:19:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以在圣经面前发誓 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}when he talked to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.41,0:19:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.13,0:19:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别这样 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Stop it boy. Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 乖狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Come on. Good dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.63,0:19:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乖狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.31,0:20:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的理论是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My theory is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.86,0:20:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}辛普森是想方设法收买情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that Simpson was under some strong{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.81,0:20:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者用别的法子让马无法上场\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}obligation to Nobble or otherwise incapacitate this horse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.69,0:20:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能参加威塞克斯杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}so that he would be unable to run in the Wessex Cup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在男孩的饭里下麻醉药倒是挺聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Clever move that, putting opium in the boy's food{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}利用那窗户很容易得手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and easy enough through that window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 下面就简单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes. Then it was simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他用一把复制好的钥匙 把马牵了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He obtained a duplicate key, led out the horse, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.66,0:20:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他运气不好 斯特拉克很警觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it was his bad luck that Straker was alert enough to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}追踪他到了野外\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}catch him up on the moor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在对抗中 马逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in the struggle the horse bolted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.67,0:20:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有证据说明\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That's no proof{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.49,0:20:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}辛普森杀了斯特拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that Simpson killed Straker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.25,0:20:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有足够对他不利的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well the evidence against him is very strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.21,0:20:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问他来这有不可告人的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He was undoubtedly here on some devious business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.51,0:20:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他给马倌下了毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He poisoned the stable lad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.84,0:20:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他手上有一根很沉的铅头手杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He had in his hand a heavy stick weighted with lead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.47,0:20:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且在死者的手上有他的围巾\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and his scarf was found in the dead man's hand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.05,0:20:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我用这些和他对质时\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And he went pale as death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.85,0:20:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真的认为在陪审团面前 证据是游刃有余了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}when I confronted him with that fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.35,0:20:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.35,0:20:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}督察 一个聪明点的律师完全可以把它们驳倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Inspector, a cleaver council would tear it all to rags.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.28,0:20:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他身上发现了复制钥匙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Has a duplicate key been found in his possession?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.70,0:21:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更重要的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And above all how could he, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.39,0:21:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个陌生人是怎么在这里把一匹马藏起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}a stranger in this district, hide a horse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.20,0:21:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更何况是一匹这样的银额马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and such a horse as Silver Blaze?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我同意证据都是间接的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I agree the evidence is circumstantial{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.71,0:21:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我认为布在\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but I think the net is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.48,0:21:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}菲茨罗·伊辛普森周围的网很紧密\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}drawn pretty tightly around Fitzroy Simpson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信他已经是网中鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and I believe he is our man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是一个怎样的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What sort of fellow is he and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.09,0:21:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么会做出这种事呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}why would he do such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.63,0:21:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}菲茨罗·伊辛普森 出身于名门望族\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Fitzroy Simpson is a man of excellent birth and dedication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很不幸地他在赛马场上输掉了一大笔财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Unfortunately he has squandered a fortune on the turf, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.60,0:21:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}导致他负债累累\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which has put him in the hands of moneylenders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.63,0:21:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且成为一个不择手段的赌马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and unscrupulous bookmakers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.85,0:21:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在赛马场上确实有这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Plenty of those sharks in the racing world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.56,0:21:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道你也会赌 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I didn't know that you were a betting man, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.19,0:21:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？我只是偶尔在赛马上下笔小赌注\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What? Oh, just the occasional flutter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.61,0:21:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜你们有了份\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I presume an inventory has been made{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯特拉克死时 他口袋里东西的清单\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}of what Straker had in his pockets at the time of his death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.98,0:21:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}东西就在 我的客厅里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have the things themselves in the sitting room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.41,0:21:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你想看的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if you would care to see them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.56,0:22:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伦敦韦斯公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Weiss & Co., London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.81,0:22:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从血迹来看 我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}From the bloodstains, I presume, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.90,0:22:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是死者 抓着的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}this is the knife that was found in the dead man's grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.23,0:22:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.65,0:22:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这更接近你的专业 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This is more in your line, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.61,0:22:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我们所称的为眼翳刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This is what we call a cataract knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.12,0:22:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常锋利的刀刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Very delicate blade devised{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.21,0:22:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}专门用于非常精密的手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for very delicate work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.20,0:22:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会有人如此随身携带\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Strange thing for a man to take on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.59,0:22:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可真稀奇 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}so rough an expedition, Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.62,0:22:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么会没有戳破他的口袋呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}especially as it wouldn't shut in his pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.46,0:22:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在尸体旁 我们找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Awe, the tip was guarded by a disc of cork, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.84,0:22:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小刀的软木圆鞘\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}which we found beside the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.21,0:22:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很出色 督察\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You impress me, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.76,0:22:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 斯特拉克夫人说原来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you. Mrs. Straker says{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.52,0:22:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它是放在梳妆台上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}it was on the dressing table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.63,0:22:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可能是 他当时最随手可得的东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It was probably the nearest thing to him at the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.39,0:22:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.64,0:22:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马料商的账单\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Corn merchants bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.85,0:22:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗斯上校的指示信\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Instructions from Colonel Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.85,0:22:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个又是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Awe what have we here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.77,0:23:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一张女衣店账单 三十七镑十五先令\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A milliner's account for 37 pounds fifteen shillings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.86,0:23:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伦敦邦德街 莱苏丽尔夫人开具\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for a Madame Lesurier, of Bond Street, London, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.41,0:23:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给 德比郡的威廉先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to a Mr. William Derbyshire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.99,0:23:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯特拉克女士告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mrs. Straker tells us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.91,0:23:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}德比郡是他丈夫的一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that Derbyshire was a friend of her husband's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偶尔他的信 会寄到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and on occasionally had his letters addressed here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.00,0:23:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}二十二几尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Twenty-two guineas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.50,0:23:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对一件衣服来说贵了点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Somewhat heavy for a single costume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.00,0:23:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}德比郡夫人喜欢贵的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mrs. Derbyshire had rather expensive taste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.09,0:23:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.55,0:23:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来没有其他有用的东西了 督察\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well there appears to be nothing more to learn here, Inspector, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.30,0:23:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们去犯罪现场吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}shall we move onto the scene of the crime?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.68,0:23:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你先 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}After you Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.40,0:23:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你抓住他们了吗 督察\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Have you got them, Inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.78,0:23:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么新消息吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Is there any more news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.03,0:23:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕没有 斯特拉克夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm afraid not, Mrs. Straker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.53,0:23:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是福尔摩斯先生和华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But Mr. Holmes and Doctor Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.20,0:23:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从伦敦赶来协助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}have come down from London to help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.37,0:23:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跟你保证 我们会全力以赴\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I assure you we're doing everything possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.37,0:24:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祝你好运 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I wish you good luck, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.58,0:24:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh thank you madam{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.75,0:24:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对你的损失深表遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and my commiserations on your great loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.25,0:24:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们肯定见过面吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Surely we've met?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.97,0:24:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之前在普利茅斯的游园会上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}At a garden party in Plymouth some time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.01,0:24:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 先生 你弄错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No sir. You are mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.35,0:24:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我可是非常肯定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No, do you know I could have sworn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.23,0:24:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你穿着一件浅灰色丝绸衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You wore a costume of dove-colored silk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.23,0:24:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上面有鸵鸟毛做的装饰物\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with ostrich feather trimming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.57,0:24:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从来没有这样的衣服 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I never had such a dress, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.03,0:24:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就清楚了 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That quite settles it. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.25,0:24:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是挂着外套的灌木\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That is the bush where the coat was hanging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.58,0:24:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那天天气怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What was the weather like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.50,0:24:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么风 雨挺大\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Wind calm bit of rain about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.63,0:24:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那外套不是被风吹到灌木上 而是人挂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And the coat was not blown against the bush but placed there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.30,0:24:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 是的 是被人放的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh yes, it was placed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.38,0:24:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}督察\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Inspector!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.09,0:24:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.68,0:24:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这片土地被太多人踏过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}So many people have trampled around this land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.94,0:25:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定有很多人到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There have been many people here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.86,0:25:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那张垫子是故意摆在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That piece of matting has been placed there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.90,0:25:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}供大家落脚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and we have all stood upon there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.23,0:25:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可老百姓不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not the general public.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.07,0:25:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我这个袋子里面有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have in this bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.24,0:25:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰·斯特拉穿的一只靴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}One of the boots John Straker wore, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.53,0:25:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一只菲茨罗·伊辛普森的鞋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}one of Fitzroy Simpson's shoes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.20,0:25:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一块银额马的马蹄铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and a cast horseshoe of Silver Blaze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.12,0:25:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 督察\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you, Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.16,0:26:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}燃了一半的蜡烛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Half burned wax candle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.74,0:26:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不敢相信我居然忽视了它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I cannot understand how I came to overlook them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.54,0:26:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们被埋在土里 自然看不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh they're invisible buried in the mud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.54,0:26:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能看见是因为我找的就是它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I only saw them because I was looking for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.54,0:26:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么 你早料到能发现它们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What, you expected to find them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.05,0:26:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为这并不是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I thought it not unlikely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.30,0:27:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕这里没有其他线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm afraid there are no more tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.39,0:27:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}周围一百码之内都检查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I've examined the ground for a hundred yards in every direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.31,0:27:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是个愉快的夜晚啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What a pleasant evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.19,0:27:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我要去散个步了 伸伸腿 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I think I'll take a walk, stretch my legs Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.65,0:27:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.31,0:27:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个我带走了 为了好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'll take this for luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.07,0:27:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后罗斯上校会来接我们回塔维斯托克\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have some work to do in the house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.40,0:27:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}屋里还有事等着我做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}then Colonel Ross is coming to take us back to Tavistock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.78,0:27:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good evening, Constable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.62,0:28:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}假设银额马挣脱了缰绳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Suppose that Silver Blaze broke away, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.45,0:28:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那它会跑到哪里去呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}where would he have gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.75,0:28:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果它还在旷野上晃悠\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If he'd run loose on the moor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.06,0:28:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到现在肯定会被人看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}he'd have surely been seen by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.80,0:28:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能那个吉普赛人的理论是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Perhaps the gypsy theory's correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.30,0:28:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.80,0:28:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马是非常喜欢群居的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A horse is a most gregarious creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.81,0:28:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然它没有回到金斯皮兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now he did not go back to King's Pyland{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.65,0:28:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自己的马厩 那就一定是去了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to his own stable, so he must have gone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.94,0:28:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅普尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to Mapleton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.65,0:28:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我们以此为假设\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now let us use that as a working hypothesis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.32,0:28:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这片土地十分干硬 但是那边的低洼地\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The ground around here is very hard and dry, but over there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.87,0:28:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在星期一的晚上肯定是很湿润\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}in that hollow it must have been very wet on Monday night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.12,0:28:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们的假设是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If our supposition is correct, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.54,0:28:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它肯定去过那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}he must have crossed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.19,0:29:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Watson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.49,0:29:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}By George, look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.70,0:29:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你瞧见了想象力的可贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You see the value of imagination{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.33,0:29:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这正是格雷戈里督察缺少的一项资质\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}is the one quality which Inspector Gregory lacks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.92,0:29:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们想象可能发生的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We imagined what might have happened, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.83,0:29:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后采取行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}acted upon the supposition, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.46,0:29:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后发现是有道理的 让我们继续吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and find ourselves justified. Let us proceed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.91,0:30:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Look! Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.63,0:30:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马和人 都折回了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Horse and man turned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.64,0:30:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（梅普尔顿驯马场 闲人禁入）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.79,0:30:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里不准闲人逗留\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No loitering around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.71,0:31:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没长眼睛吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Haven't you got eyes in your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.46,0:31:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是想问你一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I only wanted to ask you a question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.26,0:31:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是明天早晨五点我来拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Should I be too early to see Mr. Silas Brown, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.30,0:31:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}西拉斯·布朗先生 会不会太早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if I was to call around here at five-thirty tomorrow morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.30,0:31:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不应该跟你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I shouldn't be speaking to you by rights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.44,0:31:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给 男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Here lad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.94,0:31:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请收下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}please accept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.15,0:31:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保佑你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Bless you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.58,0:31:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是位绅士\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You're a gentleman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.20,0:31:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布朗先生是这里起最早的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Brown's the early bird around here all right, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.87,0:31:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}道森 你跟陌生人说三道四的干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Dawson, what are you doing gossiping with strangers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.24,0:31:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干你自己的事去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Be about your business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.37,0:31:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们两个在这里想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now what the devil do you two want around here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.67,0:31:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只占用你一点时间 布朗先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Just a few minutes of your time, Mr. Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.67,0:31:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离开这里 不然你就会被狗追着跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Be off with you or you'll find the dog on your heels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.09,0:31:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为什么要和所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Why should I talk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.28,0:31:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这旷野上游荡的陌生人说话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}every gadabout stranger on the moor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.68,0:31:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许能让你免于 被布莱克沃特勋爵解雇\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It may save you instant dismissal from Lord Blackwater's service{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.85,0:31:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会锒铛入狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and the stiffest prison sentence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.36,0:32:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}留心周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Keep guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.58,0:32:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}星期二一大早\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Early Tuesday morning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.05,0:32:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你像平时一样巡视马场\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}you're about the yard as usual, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.63,0:32:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看见了一匹马在沼泽里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}when you saw a horse on the moor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.68,0:32:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等你靠近它时你意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}When you approached it you realized{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.90,0:32:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这完全不是一匹陌生的马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that it wasn't a strange horse at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.48,0:32:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你熟知的一匹马 了如指掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It was one that you knew, very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.31,0:32:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的第一个反应就是带着银…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Your first instinct was to lead Silver…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.53,0:32:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}银额马回到金斯皮兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Silver Blaze back to King's Pyland{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.20,0:32:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是随即你有了 其他邪恶的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but then the devil put other ideas into your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.12,0:32:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有了赚一笔大钱的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You have a chance to make a great deal of money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.58,0:33:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你突然反应过来 如果把马藏起来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It occurred to you that if you were to hide the horse…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.05,0:33:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一直在看着我 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You've been watching me, haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.97,0:33:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在监视我 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You've been spying on me, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.86,0:33:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now. Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.90,0:33:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想让我做什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I do what you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.04,0:33:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你要钱 会给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If it's money you want, you shall have it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.31,0:34:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怎么说你就怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You will do exactly as I tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.53,0:34:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很少见到像西拉斯·布朗这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A more perfect compound of the bully, coward and sneak{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.41,0:34:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}集霸道 怯懦和狡猾 于一体的完美的组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that Master Silas Brown. I've seldom met with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.66,0:34:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么说马在他那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He has the horse then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.62,0:34:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.20,0:34:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是他的马厩被搜过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But his stables have been searched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.83,0:34:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像他这样的作假老手 知道很多伎俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}An old faker like him knows many a dodge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.67,0:34:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 我不知道你是否注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Watson, I didn't know whether you observed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.38,0:34:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是罗斯上校的举止有点傲慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but Colonel Ross manner has been somewhat cavalier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.26,0:34:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想要对他开点玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm inclined to have a little amusement at his expense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.97,0:34:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要向他透露任何马的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Say nothing to him about the horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.68,0:34:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有你的允许 我什么都不会说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I shall say nothing without your permission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.01,0:34:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Splendid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.27,0:34:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从我们找到的线索来看 星期一晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We have found traces which show that a party of gypsies encamped{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.52,0:34:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在凶案现场一英里之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}on Monday night within a mile of where{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.00,0:34:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普赛人在露营开过派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the murder took place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.52,0:34:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}菲茨罗·伊辛普森 可能跟他们商量好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Fitzroy Simpson may well have an understanding with them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.32,0:34:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来把马藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}over hiding the horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.70,0:34:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Nevertheless, I think I owe it to the public{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.70,0:35:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让银额马退出比赛 我依然觉得有愧于大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to remove Silver Blaze's name for the entrance for the cup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.79,0:35:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 当然不行 上校 我会让这个名字留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No, certainly not! Colonel, I should let the name stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.16,0:35:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我已经让贝阿得退出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But I've already withdrawn Bayard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.75,0:35:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我有把握 让银额马在星期六上场\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But I have every hope that Silver Blaze will start on Saturday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.05,0:35:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让你的骑师做准备吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Have your jockey at readiness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.38,0:35:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴听到你的观点 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm very glad to have your opinion, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.22,0:35:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然跟谁杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That is a minor point, of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.14,0:35:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰·斯特拉比这只是个次要问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}compared with the question of who killed John Straker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.06,0:35:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问你会专注于这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Doubtless you will be devoting yourself to that problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.52,0:35:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正好相反 华生医生和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}On the contrary, Doctor Watson and I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.40,0:35:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会坐夜间特快回伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}were taking the Night Express to London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.40,0:35:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已经呼吸过了你们这\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}We've had the most charming little{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.92,0:35:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诱人的新鲜空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}breath of your country air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.91,0:35:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你已经对缉拿杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}So you've despaired already of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.10,0:35:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰·斯特雷克的凶手丧失信心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}arresting the murderer of poor John Straker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.87,0:35:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}困难重重\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}With our certain grave difficulties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.25,0:35:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有斯特拉克的照片吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Do you have the photograph of Straker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.25,0:35:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 督察 我已经准备好去塔维斯托克了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you, Inspector. I am quite ready now for Tavistock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.21,0:35:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Linger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.59,0:36:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须说我对我们 伦敦的顾问非常失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I must say I am rather disappointed in our London consultant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.89,0:36:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有看到他来之后有任何的进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I don't see that were any further than when he came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.27,0:36:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是至少他保证了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But at least you have his assurance Colonel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.53,0:36:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的马可以参赛 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that your horse will run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.60,0:36:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 是的 他是保证了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh yes, I have his assurance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.55,0:36:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我宁愿得到马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I should prefer to have the horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.27,0:36:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得你应该采纳福尔摩斯先生的建议 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I think you should heed Mr. Holmes advice, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.65,0:36:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看情况再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well I shall have to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.83,0:36:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好意思 是谁在照看这些羊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Excuse me, whom looks after these sheep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.00,0:36:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I do, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.80,0:36:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有注意到它们最近有什么毛病吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Have you noticed anything amiss of late?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.72,0:36:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.43,0:36:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也许算不上 但是有三只羊的脚跛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well it's not much account, but three of them have gone lame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.72,0:36:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.64,0:36:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大胆的推测 华生 很大胆的推测 你先请\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A long shot, Watson, a very long shot. After you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.98,0:36:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}督察 我建议你注意下羊群中\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Inspector I would like to recommend to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.86,0:36:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种奇异病症吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the singular epidemic among the sheep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.11,0:37:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真的认为那很重要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You really consider that to be important?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.61,0:37:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Exceedingly so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.70,0:37:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走了 贝恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}All right Baynes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.05,0:37:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还需要我注意其他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Is there any other point{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.05,0:37:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一些问题吗 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to which you wish to draw my attention, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.97,0:37:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那天夜里 狗的反应很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}To the curious incident of the dog in the nighttime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.52,0:37:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是那天夜里 狗没什么反应啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But the dog did nothing in the nighttime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.60,0:37:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那正是奇怪的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}That is the curious incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.30,0:38:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的马到底在哪里 福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Where the devil is my horse, Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.97,0:38:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不 不 它到底在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}No, no, no, no. Where the devil is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.35,0:38:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜 上校 如果你看见了 就可以认出它吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I suppose, Colonel, that you would recognize him if you saw him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.23,0:38:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}认出我自己的马？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Know my own horse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.40,0:38:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在赛马场上活跃了二十年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I have been on the turf for twenty years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.73,0:38:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前从来没有被这么问过 这样该死的傻问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and I've never been asked such a damn fool question before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.07,0:38:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使是一个孩子也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A child would know Silver Blaze{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.24,0:38:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}银额马的额头上有块白色的星型\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with the white star on his forehead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.44,0:38:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后腿上有斑点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and mottled hind leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.08,0:38:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你能意识到如果我的马不上场\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I suppose you realize if my horse doesn't run, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.95,0:38:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了很可能会被人群报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}quite a part from being lynched by the crowd, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.83,0:38:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还要去向赛马调查委员会自首\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I shall be up before the Stewards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.25,0:38:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能会被每个英格兰的赛马场\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Probably warned off every racecourse in England for life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.42,0:38:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永远禁赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Reputation ruined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.72,0:38:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Here's Doctor Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.60,0:38:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而这匹 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And this, Colonel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.98,0:38:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是你的马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}is your horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.60,0:38:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不是我的马 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But that's not my horse, Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.19,0:39:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的天啊 你都干了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good God man, what have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.14,0:39:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上校啊 这就是你的银额马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There Colonel is your Silver Blaze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.27,0:39:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从盗马贼手里发现了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I found him in the hands of a faker{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.73,0:39:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原封不动带回了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and brought him to the course just as he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.70,0:39:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Good heavens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.91,0:39:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你太让我激动了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You take my breath away, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.96,0:40:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}银额马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Silver Blaze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.50,0:40:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果它还参赛的话 就会赢得名次吧 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}If he runs me lord to win a place me lord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.38,0:40:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然会\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}To win, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.09,0:40:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有谁会像你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Any more like you at home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.30,0:41:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.79,0:41:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那匹该死的马到底是怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What's the matter with the damn horse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.16,0:41:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你对它做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What have you done to him Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.54,0:41:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它失去了当领跑者的本领\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He seems to be missing his pacemaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.29,0:41:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不应该让贝阿得退出\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I should have never withdrawn Bayard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.25,0:41:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等一下 他突破重围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Wait a minute he's breaking through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.92,0:41:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加油 银额马 加油 银额马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Come on Silver Blaze. Come on Silver Blaze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.55,0:41:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快跑 快跑 快跑 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Go on. Go on. Go on. Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.29,0:42:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你创造了奇迹 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You've done wonders Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.75,0:42:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我欠你几千个道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and I owe you a thousand apologies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.74,0:42:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我怀疑了你的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}for having doubted your ability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.67,0:42:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你找回了我的马 出色得完成了工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now you've done me a great service by recovering my horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.47,0:42:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你可以抓住杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}You'd do me a greater still{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.01,0:42:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰·斯特拉的凶手的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}if you could lay your hands on the murderer of John Straker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.43,0:42:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经抓住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I've done so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.60,0:42:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？如果你已经得手 他现在人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What? What's all this about if you got him. Where is he then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.31,0:42:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}He's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.82,0:42:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里 哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Here! Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.50,0:42:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此时… 此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Some who's now present at this very moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.91,0:42:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, I quite recognize that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.97,0:42:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自己欠你一份人情 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm under obligations to you Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.53,0:42:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果这不是一个非常烂的笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but this either a very bad joke{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.34,0:42:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是一种侮辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}or an insult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.87,0:42:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 上校 真正的杀人犯 就站在你的后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh the real murderer, Colonel, is Standing immediately behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.96,0:42:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么 这匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}What the horse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.67,0:42:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 这匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, the horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.34,0:42:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我说它完全是自卫才这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And it may lessen his guilt if I say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.30,0:42:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许可以减轻它的罪过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that it was done entirely in self-defense, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.10,0:43:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且约翰·斯特拉这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and that John Straker{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.35,0:43:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全不值得你的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}was a man quite unworthy of your trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.65,0:43:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}四号 先生 第一名\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Number four, sir, winner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.72,0:43:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快来 罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Come Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.56,0:43:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.08,0:44:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.21,0:44:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十二号\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Number twelve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.25,0:44:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十二号\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Number twelve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.60,0:44:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我非常引以为豪 很骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Very proud of it. Very proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.43,0:44:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常感谢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Thank you very much. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.00,0:44:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我承认 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I confess, gentlemen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.51,0:44:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我们来金斯皮兰的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}when we came down to King's Pylan, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.12,0:44:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾经被说服了菲茨罗·伊辛普森 就是真凶\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was convinced that Fitzroy Simpson was the true culprit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.67,0:44:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的报纸和警方的报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}All the newspaper and police reports{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.86,0:44:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}似乎都指向那一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}seemed to point to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.80,0:45:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到我进入驯马师房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It was only when I entered the trainer's house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.97,0:45:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想起了咖喱羊肉具有重要意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that the immense significance of the curried mutton occurred to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.35,0:45:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要承认即使到现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I confess that even now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.53,0:45:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还不能明白它对我们有什么帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I cannot see how it helps us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.85,0:45:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麻醉药 上校 绝对不会完全无味\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Powdered opium, Colonel is by no means tasteless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.98,0:45:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说的对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I am correct?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.40,0:45:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 完全正确 味道不至于难吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh quite correct. The flavor is not distasteful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.16,0:45:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是它是可以尝出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but it is perceptible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.49,0:45:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果它混在一般的饭菜里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Were it mixed with an ordinary dish{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.41,0:45:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吃的人一定会发觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}the eater would undoubtedly detect it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.16,0:45:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能就不会继续吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but would probably eat no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.24,0:45:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}咖喱恰好 可以掩盖这股味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Curry was exactly the medium with which to disguise the taste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.50,0:45:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以那一定是斯特拉克或者是他的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}So it must have been Straker or his wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.79,0:45:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.63,0:45:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想起来你提起过狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Cause I remember you spoke of a dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.51,0:45:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 那只晚上没有吠叫的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Yes, the dog that didn't bark in the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.97,0:45:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人走进了马厩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well someone had been into the stable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.39,0:45:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且牵走了马 狗却没有叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and taken out the horse and the dog had not barked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.15,0:45:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以很明显这个午夜访客 是狗很熟悉的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}So obviously this midnight visitor was someone the dog knew well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.03,0:46:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我本来就不相信会是陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I wasn't really convinced that it was a stranger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.19,0:46:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}But for what purpose should he take out the horse, and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.74,0:46:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然他是个大骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}A dishonest one, obviously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.62,0:46:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之前就有过驯马师\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}There have been cases before now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.04,0:46:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把赌注下在\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}where trainers have made great sums of money by{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.96,0:46:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自己马的败北上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}laying against their own horses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.07,0:46:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后从中作梗而赚下一大笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and then preventing them from winning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.38,0:46:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时候故意找个骑术不佳的骑师\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well sometimes you get a pulling jockey, I will say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.72,0:46:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最狡诈的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}by surer and most subtler means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.05,0:46:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这把…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}This…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.35,0:46:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奇特的刀 是在死者的手上发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}singular knife, it was found in the dead man's hand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.11,0:46:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正常人不会用它当作武器 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and which no sane man would use as a weapon, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.90,0:46:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 是的 只有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Oh yes, only, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.06,0:46:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有在最精密的手术里才会使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}only used in the most delicate operations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.95,0:46:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它那天晚上是用在了一个很精密的手术上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It was used for a very delicate operation that night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.50,0:46:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.29,0:47:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如你所知 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}As you know, Colonel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.67,0:47:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凭你丰富的赛马经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with your wide knowledge of turf matters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.05,0:47:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在马的后踝骨腱子肉上 从皮下划一小道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that it is possible to make a slight nick in the horse's tendon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.52,0:47:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}轻轻的伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and do it, subcutaneously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.86,0:47:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}轻微的跛足 会被认为是训练过度\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Any slight lameness will be put down to a strain in training{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.24,0:47:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是挫伤 不会被想到是一个肮脏的阴谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}or bruised, never foul play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.79,0:47:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恶棍 该死的无赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Villain! The damn Scoundrel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.37,0:47:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}手术不能在马厩里进行 我不要吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Not an operation to be done in the stable. No food for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.00,0:47:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马这么敏感的生物 会吵醒熟睡的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}So sensitive a creature would arouse the soundest of sleepers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.18,0:47:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和格雷戈里都瞎了眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I've been blind and Gregory too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.51,0:47:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怪不得他需要蜡烛 还有划过的火柴\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Of course, that's why he needed the candle and struck the match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.89,0:47:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我检查随身物品时\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}When I examined Straker's belongings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.29,0:47:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我非常幸运地不仅发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I was fortunate enough to discover{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.56,0:48:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的犯罪方法 还有犯罪动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}not only the method of the crime but also the motive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.36,0:48:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大部分人不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Most men do not{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.17,0:48:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把别人的账单 放进自己的口袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}carry other people's bills in their pockets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.03,0:48:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从这点我总结出\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}From this I concluded that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.94,0:48:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯特拉克是过着双重身份的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Straker was leading a double life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.99,0:48:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那账单的种类可以看出\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The nature of the bill shows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.66,0:48:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个案子里有一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that there was a woman in the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.33,0:48:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且是一个喜欢昂贵东西的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}And a woman of expensive taste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.33,0:48:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管你对你的仆人很大方\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Liberal though you are with your servants, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.25,0:48:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很确定他们也承受不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I'm sure they're not able to afford{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.63,0:48:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}花二十二几尼为女人买件衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}twenty-two guinea, walking dresses for their ladies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.39,0:48:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照斯特拉克夫人的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mrs. Straker never had{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.40,0:48:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她从来没有这样的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}one by her own admission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.06,0:48:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二天早上我去邦德街\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}When I visited Bond Street the other morning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.89,0:48:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把斯特拉克的照片 给莱苏丽尔夫人时\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I showed Madame Lesurier this photograph of Straker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.15,0:48:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她认出了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}She recognized him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.61,0:48:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是一位很好的顾客\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}as an extremely good customer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.72,0:48:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叫威廉 德比郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}called William Derbyshire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.37,0:49:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一位非常时髦的年轻妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with a very dashing young wife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.46,0:49:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她非常偏爱昂贵的裙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}with a partiality for expensive dresses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.71,0:49:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女人 女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Women! Women!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.09,0:49:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}I suppose it was she who plunged him head over heels into debt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.89,0:49:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯特拉克把银额马领到低洼地\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Straker let out Silver Blaze into the hollow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.56,0:49:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那里 他的烛光不会被马场的人看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}where his light would not be visible from the yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.07,0:49:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}辛普森在逃跑中 落下了围巾\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Simpson in his flight had dropped his scarf{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.16,0:49:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯特拉克捡起了它 毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Straker picked it up with the idea, no doubt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.08,0:49:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是要用 绑住马腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}that he might use it in securing the horses leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.71,0:49:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯特拉克把蜡烛点着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Straker was able to light his candle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.09,0:49:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是就在他准备动刀时 马突然给\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}but just as he had the knife ready the horse lashed out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.93,0:49:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的额头来了致命一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}and caught him a fatal blow on the forehead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.94,0:50:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？为什么马会突然发起攻击呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Why? And why did the horse lash out so suddenly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.86,0:50:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是被蜡烛 还是刀吓着了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Frightened by the candle, the knife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.41,0:50:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}动物有一种奇怪的本能\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well animals have a strange instinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.70,0:50:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们似乎知道 谁不怀好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}They seem to know when some mischief is intended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.13,0:50:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须承认 我最后的推测非常大胆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}My final shot I must confess, was a long one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.34,0:50:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我突然想到 像斯特拉克这样精明的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It struck me that such astute man, as Straker{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.60,0:50:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在进行马腱手术之前一定做过练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}would not undertake this tendon-nicking without a little practice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.53,0:50:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些羊 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The sheep! Of course!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.07,0:50:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太精彩了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Wonderful, my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.66,0:51:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在你只剩下一件事没有解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Now you've explained all but one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.33,0:51:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那匹马 马在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}The horse. Now where was the horse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.83,0:51:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Well I think we must have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.63,0:51:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须要宽容一点 上校\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}a little amnesty in that direction, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.72,0:51:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它在外面被你其中一位邻居照顾着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}It bolted and was looked after by one of your neighbors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.11,0:51:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们我现在为你们献上一段祝酒词\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Gentlemen I give you a toast{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.20,0:51:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}献给银额马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}to Silver Blaze{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.03,0:51:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}coupled with the names of my friends, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.70,0:51:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生和华生医生之名\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}Mr. Sherlock Holmes and Doctor Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.88,0:51:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敬银额马\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\blur3}To Silver Blaze.{\r}
